Use existing frozen/extra-forbid `BaseConfig` (W:python/owl/config.py:26), strict numeric validation at the new boundary and explicit serialization. Native revalidates independently.

`KaggricultureGameConfig` in types.py: snake_case Python fields with the kernel's camelCase aliases; `to_native_json() -> str` emits resolved aliases and permitted framework metadata. Defaults below are **documented game defaults**, not hidden reward coefficients. Required envelope/representability checks come from W:docs/kaggriculture-contract.md:17–26 and W:engine_rs/src/lib.rs:667–756.

