cookbook/decisions/preserve-the-ppo-recipe-across-bc-bootstrap.md:16:Owner subsequently directs: “你可以對齊全部參數吧 基本建設都在了isaiah, 我們盡量對齊”, and rejects the remaining teacher gaps. This supersedes freezing the old recipe for future runs, while preserving historical snapshots and checkpoint custody. The selected source is upstream scaling_6m; new GPU YAMLs are partial until adapters and qualification are complete. The owner later states that the remaining batch-cadence and critic choices are not owner decisions; [[recipe-choices-align-to-isaiah-without-owner-escalation|the alignment Decision]] resolves them toward Isaiah. The 4,096-environment fixed-minibatch figures below describe the preserved historical recipe only.
